    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** Under Offer ** Sherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to bring this 4-bedroom end of row two storey residence to the market. The property is set on a large site complete with outbuildings.\n\nThe residence is conveniently located in the village within walking distance of all local amenities including primary school, church and local pubs.\n\nAccommodation comprises: Entrance Hallway, Lounge / Sitting Room, Kitchen / Dining Room and Utility. First floor accommodation comprises: Landing, 4 bedrooms (2 double, 2 single) and a family bathroom.\n\nWith a previous commercial history, the property offers excellent potential for a purchaser seeking a family home with additional space and development opportunities. The outbuildings are suitable for a variety of uses including storage, workshop space or hobby use.\n\nThe property has connections available to all mains services and has double glazed uPVC windows fitted throughout.\n\nHaving been vacant for over two years, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant subject to the relevant terms and conditions.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Lobby - 1.98m x 1.24m\nwith glazed door panels\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 5.67m x 2.41m\nwith open fireplace, carpet flooring & 2 windows\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.68m x 3.76m\nfitted kitchen with linoleum flooring, wall tiles, range & 2 windows\n\nUtility Room - 2.45m x 2.43m\nwith fitted units, linoleum flooring, window and door to rear / store\n\nLanding - 1.88m x 0.98m\nwith carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.63m x 2.45m\ndouble with wooden flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.51m x 2.83m\ndouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.77m x 2.13m\nsingle with linoleum flooring & window\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.45m x 2.43m\nsingle with linoleum flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.44m x 1.47m\nMira Elite shower, bath, linoleum flooring & wall tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nOutbuildings - \n\n\nFormer Retail / Commercial Unit - 18sqm\n\n\nStore - 6sqm\n\n\nGarage & Store - 42sqm\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bedroom, 1 bathroom semi-detached residence</li><li>Large selection of outbuildings suitable for a variety of uses</li><li>Conveniently located within walking distance of all local amenities including national school, church and pubs</li><li>Mains connections available to all essential services </li><li>Double glazed uPVC windows fitted throughout.</li><li>Fibre broadband available </li><li>May qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant subject to qualifying criteria</li><li></li><li>Distances: </li><li>Castleisland 10 mins </li><li>Listowel 20 mins</li><li>Ballybunion 35 mins</ul>"
      },
